  "faq": [
    {
      "q": "Do I need to book to watch live sport?",
      "a": "Just want to watch the match? There's no need to book to watch in the bar area. You can book a VIP 4-metre viewing bay, with match day packages from £15pp."
    },
    {
      "q": "How do I book for a big group?",
      "a": "Groups of 15 or under can book online. Groups of 16+: speak to our party team and we'll tee up the perfect celebration."
    },
    {
      "q": "How many players per golf bay?",
      "a": "Up to six players per bay."
    },
    {
      "q": "Is there an age limit?",
      "a": "Unlimited Crazy + Drink (Friday & Saturday 7pm - close) is over 18s only. Crazy golf is £9 for under 16s."
    },
    {
      "q": "Are there discounts on kids parties?",
      "a": "Book a Kids Party Monday to Friday and save 25%. Excludes school holidays, Bank Holidays and select dates."
    },
    {
      "q": "Do you offer junior coaching?",
      "a": "Junior group coaching Tuesdays & Thursdays: ages 6-10 5pm-6pm, ages 11-16 6pm-7pm, from £7 per child."
    },
    {
      "q": "Is there anything extra at crazy golf?",
      "a": "There's even a silent disco which is free to use."
    }
  ],
